oskinson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Add two financial patterns that compare every execution prefix through the Core library and public CLI: a three-recipient payout and a reserve, partial-spend and refund sequence.\n\nThe payout checks four complete prefixes and effects, preserved observer balances and duties, gross debit 25 including fee 2, and logical work 8. Full Program and CLI comparisons retain explicit assumptions about source-specific expression IDs and exact output formatting. The reserve example checks 20 financial prefixes and 17 effects: gross debit stays 100 after refund 20, while the remaining reserve and duty are both 40. Its allowance counters are application state.\n\nValidation on `98db9d3cf7a7e1227fdbbd9e6d5d3c2d848a6453` (tree `6f78f49dc3cc643c423a5c0c4f9d85fa9a0aa09b`): five tests passed, none failed or filtered, in 55.612 seconds. Complete library outcomes and CLI streams were captured before comparisons. The first run failed because the test omitted indices from cumulative-effect records; fixing that adapter preserved every oracle byte. Both runs remain recorded. The checkout stayed clean, temporary files were removed, and diff-check passed. Independent source/result review is pending. Compiler, proof, ledger and whole-family qualification remain open.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-18T14:20:22Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T14:20:22Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"c3f2b3453434d3ca1e9728bdb6e7dc9febec22ef","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"CharlesHoskinson:doctorwatson-language/payout-and-reserve-prefixes-20261018","ref":"doctorwatson-language/payout-and-reserve-prefixes-20261018","repo":{"id":1360485122,"node_id":"R_kgDOURdbAg","name":"Moriarty","full_name":"CharlesHoskinson/Moriarty","owner":{"login":"CharlesHoskinson","id":3279952,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzk